  m_text: 'to control:

    WASD or Arrow keys - movement

    LeftShift+movement
    -run or turn 180

    1,2,3,..0 - Emotions (punches and kicks in Battle mode)

    Space
    - jump / jump forward / jump while run

    T -talk

    H - get hit

    U -
    fall front

    R - up

    F - down

    Q/E - strafe


    Backspace - reset
    emotion


    TAB - togle Battle mode


    *to get up from a lying position
    just press and hold W'
